                                                "sense_id": "a847d314-0909-39eb-aeeb-94184975c8d1",
                                                "text": "And I can assure you, were he to encounter the entire crew of the aircraft carrier Enterprise, he’d serve them eggs sunny-side up, and labneh fresh from the bag."
